  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancement of the Policy, Legal and Regulatory Environment and
Capacity Building for Renewable Energy and Energy Efficiency</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the project of which this contract will be a part is to increase access to clean, reliable and affordable energy and promote renewable energy production and energy efficiency in Zambia.The proposed service contract shall: 1. support public institutions in Zambia to revise and further develop the policies as well as the institutional, legal and regulatory frameworks for unlocking the potential of renewable energy and to increase energy efficiency throughout the country; 2. build capacity of both public and private sector stakeholders to ensure adequate know-how transfer and skills development and support local actors to promote long term and nation-wide supply with cost effective, reliable and sustainable energies.The same service provider shall be in charge of a multi-annual Programme Estimate covering capacity building activities and awareness campaigns, in private indirect decentralised management.</narrative>
  </description>
